  "title": "Build an insurance claim notice log that records the policy, tender, and acknowledgment",
  "excerpt": "An insurance claim notice log that records the policy version, the notice and tender dates, and each carrier response while counsel keeps the coverage analysis.",
  "published": "2026-11-19",
